{"ref": "Psalms 19:8-10", "heRef": "תהילים י״ט:ח׳-י׳", "isComplex": false, "text": ["<span class=\"poetry indentAll\">The teaching of G<small>OD</small> is perfect,</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">renewing life;</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">the decrees of G<small>OD</small> are enduring,</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">making the simple wise,</span>", "<span class=\"poetry indentAll\">The precepts of G<small>OD</small> are just,</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">rejoicing the heart;</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">the instruction of G<small>OD</small> is lucid,</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">making the eyes light up.</span>", "<span class=\"poetry indentAll\">The fear of G<small>OD</small> is pure,</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">abiding forever;</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">the judgments of G<small>OD</small> are true,</span><br><span class=\"poetry indentAllDouble\">righteous altogether,</span>"], "he": ["תּ֘וֹרַ֤ת יְהֹוָ֣ה תְּ֭מִימָה מְשִׁ֣יבַת נָ֑פֶשׁ עֵד֥וּת יְהֹוָ֥ה נֶ֝אֱמָנָ֗ה מַחְכִּ֥ימַת פֶּֽתִי׃", "פִּקּ֘וּדֵ֤י יְהֹוָ֣ה יְ֭שָׁרִים מְשַׂמְּחֵי־לֵ֑ב מִצְוַ֥ת יְהֹוָ֥ה בָּ֝רָ֗ה מְאִירַ֥ת עֵינָֽיִם׃", "יִרְאַ֤ת יְהֹוָ֨ה&thinsp;<b>׀</b> טְהוֹרָה֮ עוֹמֶ֢דֶת לָ֫עַ֥ד מִֽשְׁפְּטֵי־יְהֹוָ֥ה אֱמֶ֑ת צָֽדְק֥וּ יַחְדָּֽו׃"], "versions": [{"status": "locked", "priority": 3.0, "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionNotes": "<a href=\"https://purl.org/jps/rjps-preface\">Preface</a>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://purl.org/jps/gender\">Notes on Gender in Translation</a>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://purl.org/scholar/rjps-comm\">Commentary on Translation Choices in the JPS TANAKH (RJPS)</a>", "formatAsPoetry": "", "digitizedBySefaria": "", "method": "", "heversionSource": "", "versionUrl": "", "versionTitleInHebrew": "", "versionNotesInHebrew": "", "shortVersionTitle": "Revised JPS, 2023", "shortVersionTitleInHebrew": "", "extendedNotes": "", "exten